# The build context is the repository root, and the four Dockerfiles copy only
# the Go module files, the four service directories, and the Go packages the
# services share. Everything else is excluded here so it neither slows the
# build nor reaches an image: exclude all, then name back what a COPY needs.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!go-api
!go-grpc
!internal
!migrate
!rust-inventory

# Local build output. It is large, it is host-specific, and cargo rebuilds
# inside the image anyway.
rust-inventory/target
